.TH "SOPLOS-APPIMAGE-MANAGER" "1" "2026-10-19" "Soplos Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
soplos-appimage-manager \- AppImage application manager and desktop integrator for Soplos Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B soplos-appimage-manager
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIFILE.AppImage\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B soplos-appimage-manager
is the AppImage integration and management tool for Soplos Linux.
Built with Tauri 2, Rust, and Svelte architecture, it enables users to seamlessly integrate standalone AppImage binaries into the desktop environment:
.IP \[bu] 2
Moves AppImages into the user's personal \fI~/AppImages/\fR directory or keeps a copy.
.IP \[bu]
Extracts icons and desktop metadata automatically via 7-Zip or internal extractor.
.IP \[bu]
Generates and installs freedesktop compliant \fI.desktop\fR menu entries into \fI~/.local/share/applications/\fR.
.IP \[bu]
Performs automatic update checks against GitHub, GitLab, Codeberg releases, and direct HTTP download URLs.
.IP \[bu]
Supports editing names, versions, descriptions, categories, and optional execution with elevated privileges.
.IP \[bu]
Monitors \fI~/AppImages/\fR in real time with an automatic filesystem watcher.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show summary of options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/AppImages/
Default storage directory for integrated AppImage applications.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/applications/
User desktop entries created for integrated AppImages.
.TP
.I ~/.config/soplos-appimage-manager/
Application configuration and metadata cache.
